OL,3,GNEWSAAquarium shark that helped 'dispel
OL,4,Amyths' dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sand tiger shark that had been at an
OL,7,Faquarium since its opening almost 30
OL,8,Fyears ago has died.
OL,10,FStaff at the National Marine Aquarium
OL,11,F(NMA) in Plymouth said they had noticed
OL,12,Fchanges in the behaviour and condition
OL,13,Fof Howard, also known as Howie, and she
OL,14,Fwas put to sleep after not responding
OL,15,Fto medical intervention.
OL,17,FShe was initially living in the Great
OL,18,FBarrier Reef habitat before moving to
OL,19,Fthe Atlantic Ocean habitat where she
OL,20,Fgrew to 9ft (2.7m) long.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
