OL,3,GNEWSAAquarium shark that helped 'dispel
OL,4,Amyths' dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe team said the shark was believed to
OL,7,Fhave been almost 30 years old and acted
OL,8,Fas an "incredible ambassador, helping
OL,9,Fto dispel many of the myths around this
OL,10,Fcritically endangered species".
